OL,5,G0000 Surgeons: A Matter of Life or
OL,6,G     Death
OL,7,     FAn ENT surgeon must operate on
OL,8,     FSarah, whose bone tumour is
OL,9,     Fpushing into her skull. Mike, who
OL,10,     Fhas pancreatic cancer, has a
OL,11,     Fhigh-risk but potentially
OL,12,     Flife-saving operation.
OL,13,G0100 Cold Case Killers
OL,14,     FThirty years after an unsolved
OL,15,     Fmurder, could changed loyalties
OL,16,     Fhelp find Sally McGrath's
OL,17,     Fmurderer? And was a series of
OL,18,     Funsolved sexual assaults connected
OL,19,     Fto the killing?
